"Crossroads of Europe. DE-KICKS IX, cheap transit.":"Encruzilhada da Europa. IX DE-KICKS, transit barato.",
"Huge eyeball market. Pricey neighbours.":"Mercado enorme de eyeballs. Vizinhos caros.",
"Asia hub. Great peering, far from home.":"Hub da Ásia. Ótimo peering, longe de casa.",
"Big hungry market, few providers.":"Mercado grande e faminto, poucos provedores.",
